      "mentions": 74,
      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive specialty veterinarians and technicians"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend specialists such as Dr. Patrick, Dr. Linn, and Dr. Hatfield, along with supportive receptionists and emergency veterinary nurses. Many pet owners appreciate their empathy and attentiveness during critical crises, though several reviewers felt staff appeared detached or transactional."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 53,
      "title": {
        "en": "Life-saving emergency and surgical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Numerous reviews emphasize successful treatments for critical pet emergencies, including foreign body ingestions, respiratory distress, and complex orthopedic surgeries. Pet owners credit the medical specialists with saving pets' lives, although a few clients experienced heartbreaking outcomes during severe illness."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 23,
      "title": {
        "en": "Dedicated care for critically ill pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents highlight the compassionate care provided to vulnerable pets during hospital stays and intensive monitoring. Reviewers describe clinical teams who treat distressed animals with tenderness and comfort, helping both anxious dogs and frail cats remain as settled as possible during admissions."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is emergency veterinary care available around the clock?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, reviewers confirm that the hospital operates 24/7 for urgent pet medical crises and trauma stabilization."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What medical specialties are offered at this facility?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The hospital provides board-certified veterinary specialty services including emergency critical care, orthopedic surgery, and internal medicine."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients view the cost of emergency procedures?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers note that specialized testing and intensive emergency treatments can be costly, with detailed treatment estimates provided prior to admission."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are pet owners kept updated during hospital stays?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Many clients praise the clinical staff for providing regular status updates, though communication during shift transitions can occasionally cause delays."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    }
